<div class="page-head"><div><a class="back-link" href="/accounting#supplier-<%= bill.id %>">‹ Supplier bill</a><p class="eyebrow">Supplier credit memo</p><h1>Record credit from <%= bill.supplier_name %></h1><p class="lede">The original bill stays intact. The credit is recorded separately, reduces what you owe, and adjusts evidenced product or expense cost without changing inventory quantity.</p></div></div>

<div class="notice"><div><strong><%= bill.supplier_invoice_number || bill.bill_number %> · <%= helpers.money(bill.balance_minor,bill.currency) %> still owed</strong><br>A credit cannot exceed the remaining balance. If products physically left your warehouse, record the supplier return in Inventory/Purchasing as a separate physical event too.</div></div>

<form method="post" action="/accounting/supplier-credits" class="stack-xl"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="billId" value="<%= bill.id %>"><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>What did the supplier credit?</h2></div><div class="card-body grid grid--2"><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Credit amount</span><input class="input" name="amount" inputmode="decimal" required placeholder="0.00"></label><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Credit date</span><input class="input" type="date" name="creditDate" value="<%= today %>" required></label><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Credit memo number (optional)</span><input class="input" name="creditNumber" maxlength="80"></label><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Reason</span><input class="input" name="reason" maxlength="250" placeholder="Price correction, damaged goods, return…"></label></div></section><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Record supplier credit</button><span class="hint">This does not claim cash was paid or inventory physically moved.</span></div></form>
